anty claims. Adjustments are made to the accruals as claims and data experience warrant.</ix:continuation> Our liabilities for warranties as of June&#160;30, 2026 and December&#160;31, 2025 were </span><span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-3" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:ProductWarrantyAccrual" scale="6" id="f-484">0.4</ix:nonFraction> million</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-4" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:ProductWarrantyAccrual" scale="6" id="f-485">0.3</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfProductWarrantyLiabilityTableTextBlock" id="f-486" continuedAt="f-486-1" escape="true">The following tables present a summary of our accrued warranty liabilities, which are recorded within the Company's accounts payable and accrued liabilities, for the six months ended June 30, 2026 and the twelve months ended December 31, 2025 (in thousands):</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><ix:continuation id="f-486-1"><div style="margin-bottom:12pt;text-align:center"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:98.237%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:80.466%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:17.334%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><div style="margin-bottom:12pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">2026</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span